<title>QATAR: Qatar warplane crashes but pilot unhurt.</title>
<headline>Qatar warplane crashes but pilot unhurt.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Qatari Mirage fighter jet crashed during a routine training flight on Saturday, the official Qatar News Agency said.</p>
<p>Quoting an armed forces official, the agency said the pilot of the airforce jet was not injured in the crash. It did not say where the accident occurred or give any further details.</p>
